SageIII provides the Sage AST and its supporting interfaces. ROSETTA generates
the Cxx_Grammar sources and headers in the build tree.

astJson serializes and reconstructs the typed AST.
astPostProcessing validates constructed ASTs and resets mutation bookkeeping.
astTokenStream supports token-aware source emission.
sageInterface provides AST construction, query, and transformation helpers.
virtualCFG provides a control-flow graph over Sage nodes.

The Clang and Flang frontends live in src/frontend/Clang and
src/frontend/Flang, respectively.
